OL,3,AAt least 27 dead and hundreds evacuated
OL,4,Aafter strike on Kyiv warehouse
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwenty-seven people have been killed
OL,7,Fand almost 400 evacuated after a
OL,8,FRussian drone strike hit a warehouse in
OL,9,Fthe Kyiv region late on Friday.
OL,11,FPresident Volodymyr Zelensky said the
OL,12,Fattack triggered an explosion which
OL,13,Fdamaged a nearby care home and
OL,14,Fresidential buildings, with an
OL,15,Finvestigation launched into whether
OL,16,Fammunition was being stored on site.
OL,18,FFour children are among 42 people
OL,19,Finjured, according to regional head
OL,20,FTymur Tkachenko, with search and rescue
OL,21,Foperations ongoing at the site in the
OL,22,FBucha district early on Saturday.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
