OL,3,AAt least 27 dead and hundreds evacuated
OL,4,Aafter strike on Kyiv warehouse
OL,5,
OL,6,FZelensky wrote on X: "The regulations
OL,7,Fare clear: Ammunition must not be
OL,8,Fstored near houses or other residential
OL,9,Fbuildings. Appropriate conclusions will
OL,10,Fcertainly be drawn."
